---
layout: base.njk
title: Lick Library
description: Free guitar licks with full video lessons and downloadable tabs. New licks added regularly.
permalink: /licks/
---
<style>
  .tag-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 4px 0 0; }
  .tag-chip { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s; }
  .tag-chip:hover { color: var(--white); border-color: var(--purple-lt); }
  .tag-chip.is-active { color: var(--white); background: var(--purple); border-color: var(--purple); }
  .licks-optin { margin: 36px 0 44px; padding: 28px 32px; border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--card); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; }
  .licks-optin-copy { flex: 1 1 340px; }
  .licks-optin h2 { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .licks-optin p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .licks-optin-btn { flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-block; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.98rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--purple); color: var(--white); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .licks-optin-btn:hover { background: var(--purple-lt); }
</style>
<header class="notes-header">
  <h1>Lick Library</h1>
  <p>Free guitar licks with a full video lesson and downloadable tab for each one. Browse by technique, or scroll the whole collection below.</p>
  <div class="tag-bar">
    <a class="tag-chip is-active" href="/licks/">All</a>
    {% for tech in collections.techniques %}
    <a class="tag-chip" href="/licks/technique/{{ tech.slug }}/">{{ tech.name }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</header>
<div class="licks-optin">
  <div class="licks-optin-copy">
    <h2>Get every lick, free</h2>
    <p>Drop your email and I'll send you the entire library: the Guitar Pro and MIDI files for every lick, ready to open, slow down, and study. New licks added all the time.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="licks-optin-btn" href="https://sunny-musician-9538.kit.com/6d6291a73f">Email me the full lick library</a>
</div>
<ul class="notes-list">
  {% for lick in collections.licks %}
  <li class="notes-list-item">
    <a href="{{ lick.url }}">
      <h2>{{ lick.data.title }}</h2>
      {% if lick.data.summary %}<p>{{ lick.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="notes-list-foot">
        <span class="meta">
          {%- for t in lick.data.techniques %}{{ t }}{% if not loop.last %} &middot; {% endif %}{% endfor -%}
          {%- if lick.data.key %} &middot; {{ lick.data.key }}{% endif -%}
        </span>
        <span class="notes-list-read">Open lesson &#8594;</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
